  "description": "The Horizon Tour 30 Wave is built for comfortable, low-maintenance everyday riding, combining practical features with a low step-through frame that makes mounting and dismounting easy. LED lighting improves visibility in busy urban areas, while the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes it simple to attach accessories or a child seat.\n\nIts internal gear hub keeps shifting smooth and maintenance low, and the Shimano coaster brake system provides simple, intuitive braking with minimal upkeep. An adjustable stem helps you find a comfortable riding position, and SP Connect allows secure smartphone mounting for everyday journeys. Full-coverage fenders help keep you clean and dry, while a 100mm suspension fork absorbs rough tracks and unpaved sections for added comfort on longer routes. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires offer strong puncture protection and secure traction for daily urban riding.\n\nPower comes from the Bosch Performance Line drive unit, providing strong, quiet assistance for extended adventures. The 540Wh Bosch PowerTube battery sits neatly inside the frame and can be removed for off-bike charging, with the cover remaining in place to protect the compartment. The bike is also compatible with the Bosch PowerMore range extender, giving you the option to boost your range when needed. Thanks to the Bosch Smart System and eBike Flow App, you can easily access bike data, connectivity features and any available upgrades.",
